Description: GNOME / Printing and scanning
 Completes the print and scan story.  asgard-gnome-desktop ships
 the system-config-printer UI shim but not the CUPS print server
 itself or scanner tools.  This task adds cups for the print
 daemon plus cups-pk-helper for PolicyKit-elevated printer admin
 plus simple-scan for scanner capture.  Selecting this task pulls
 the GNOME desktop set automatically.
